    "title": "SOLAR SYSTEM",
    "content": "[vc_row][vc_column][woodmart_title size=\"medium\" font_weight=\"600\" tag=\"h1\" woodmart_css_id=\"696779ceece46\" title=\"Solar System 3D Models – Planets, Earth, Moon and Lunar Surface Models\" responsive_spacing=\"eyJwYXJhbV90eXBlIjoid29vZG1hcnRfcmVzcG9uc2l2ZV9zcGFjaW5nIiwic2VsZWN0b3JfaWQiOiI2OTY3NzljZWVjZTQ2Iiwic2hvcnRjb2RlIjoid29vZG1hcnRfdGl0bGUiLCJkYXRhIjp7InRhYmxldCI6e30sIm1vYmlsZSI6e319fQ==\" after_color=\"eyJwYXJhbV90eXBlIjoid29vZG1hcnRfY29sb3JwaWNrZXIiLCJjc3NfYXJncyI6eyJjb2xvciI6WyIgLnRpdGxlLWFmdGVyX3RpdGxlIl19LCJzZWxlY3Rvcl9pZCI6IjY5Njc3OWNlZWNlNDYiLCJkYXRhIjp7ImRlc2t0b3AiOiIjZGQ5OTMzIn19\" title_custom_color=\"eyJwYXJhbV90eXBlIjoid29vZG1hcnRfY29sb3JwaWNrZXIiLCJjc3NfYXJncyI6eyJjb2xvciI6WyIgLndvb2RtYXJ0LXRpdGxlLWNvbnRhaW5lciJdfSwic2VsZWN0b3JfaWQiOiI2OTY3NzljZWVjZTQ2IiwiZGF0YSI6eyJkZXNrdG9wIjoiIzdhOWM1OSJ9fQ==\" wd_hide_on_desktop=\"no\" wd_hide_on_tablet=\"no\" wd_hide_on_mobile=\"no\"][vc_separator style=\"shadow\" wd_hide_on_desktop=\"no\" wd_hide_on_tablet=\"no\" wd_hide_on_mobile=\"no\"][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row][vc_column][woodmart_text_block woodmart_css_id=\"69677b3c20a55\" woodmart_inline=\"no\" responsive_spacing=\"eyJwYXJhbV90eXBlIjoid29vZG1hcnRfcmVzcG9uc2l2ZV9zcGFjaW5nIiwic2VsZWN0b3JfaWQiOiI2OTY3N2IzYzIwYTU1Iiwic2hvcnRjb2RlIjoid29vZG1hcnRfdGV4dF9ibG9jayIsImRhdGEiOnsidGFibGV0Ijp7fSwibW9iaWxlIjp7fX19\" parallax_scroll=\"no\" wd_hide_on_desktop=\"no\" wd_hide_on_tablet=\"no\" wd_hide_on_mobile=\"no\"]\r\n<p data-start=\"373\" data-end=\"762\">The <strong data-start=\"377\" data-end=\"393\">Solar System</strong> category features a curated collection of <strong data-start=\"436\" data-end=\"520\">high-quality 3D models of planets, Earth, the Moon, and lunar surface formations</strong>, designed for professional visualization, education, research, and creative projects. These models provide an accurate and visually compelling representation of celestial bodies, planetary surfaces, and gravitational or topographic features.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"764\" data-end=\"1149\">The collection includes <strong data-start=\"788\" data-end=\"887\">planetary 3D models of Mercury, Venus, Earth, Mars, Jupiter, Saturn, Uranus, Neptune, and Pluto</strong>, as well as detailed <strong data-start=\"909\" data-end=\"924\">Moon models</strong>, <strong data-start=\"926\" data-end=\"952\">lunar surface datasets</strong>, and <strong data-start=\"958\" data-end=\"994\">high-resolution 3D crater models</strong> such as Copernicus and Theophilus. Each product is created with a focus on geometric accuracy, clean topology, and compatibility with modern 3D workflows.</p>\r\n[/woodmart_text_block][woodmart_image img_align=\"center\" rounding_size=\"\" woodmart_css_id=\"666414d9d2624\" display_inline=\"no\" parallax_scroll=\"no\" responsive_spacing=\"eyJwYXJhbV90eXBlIjoid29vZG1hcnRfcmVzcG9uc2l2ZV9zcGFjaW5nIiwic2VsZWN0b3JfaWQiOiI2NjY0MTRkOWQyNjI0Iiwic2hvcnRjb2RlIjoid29vZG1hcnRfaW1hZ2UiLCJkYXRhIjp7InRhYmxldCI6e30sIm1vYmlsZSI6e319fQ==\" woodmart_box_shadow=\"no\" wd_hide_on_desktop=\"no\" wd_hide_on_tablet=\"no\" wd_hide_on_mobile=\"no\" img_id=\"17102\" img_size=\"full\"][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row][vc_column][woodmart_text_block woodmart_css_id=\"69677b4ce4968\" woodmart_inline=\"no\" responsive_spacing=\"eyJwYXJhbV90eXBlIjoid29vZG1hcnRfcmVzcG9uc2l2ZV9zcGFjaW5nIiwic2VsZWN0b3JfaWQiOiI2OTY3N2I0Y2U0OTY4Iiwic2hvcnRjb2RlIjoid29vZG1hcnRfdGV4dF9ibG9jayIsImRhdGEiOnsidGFibGV0Ijp7fSwibW9iaWxlIjp7fX19\" parallax_scroll=\"no\" wd_hide_on_desktop=\"no\" wd_hide_on_tablet=\"no\" wd_hide_on_mobile=\"no\"]\r\n<h2 data-start=\"1156\" data-end=\"1198\">Realistic Planetary and Earth 3D Models</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1200\" data-end=\"1583\">Our Solar System models are suitable for a wide range of applications, from <strong data-start=\"1276\" data-end=\"1328\">scientific visualization and astronomy education</strong> to <strong data-start=\"1332\" data-end=\"1382\">3D rendering, motion graphics, and digital art</strong>. Earth models in this category include advanced datasets such as <strong data-start=\"1448\" data-end=\"1520\">satellite maps, DEM elevation data, gravity maps, and terrain models</strong>, enabling realistic global and planetary-scale visualizations.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1585\" data-end=\"1879\">Planetary models are optimized for rendering and presentation, offering reliable UV mapping and high-resolution textures where applicable. Lunar assets include both <strong data-start=\"1750\" data-end=\"1770\">full Moon globes</strong> and <strong data-start=\"1775\" data-end=\"1806\">surface-level crater models</strong>, making them ideal for close-up analysis and educational demonstrations.</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<hr data-start=\"1881\" data-end=\"1884\" />\r\n\r\n<h2 data-start=\"1886\" data-end=\"1927\">Applications of Solar System 3D Models</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1929\" data-end=\"2612\">\r\n \t<li data-start=\"1929\" data-end=\"2064\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1931\" data-end=\"2064\"><strong data-start=\"1931\" data-end=\"1958\">Education and Astronomy</strong><br data-start=\"1958\" data-end=\"1961\" />Visualize the Solar System, planetary structure, and lunar geology in a clear and engaging 3D format.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n \t<li data-start=\"2066\" data-end=\"2220\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2068\" data-end=\"2220\"><strong data-start=\"2068\" data-end=\"2111\">Scientific and Geospatial Visualization</strong><br data-start=\"2111\" data-end=\"2114\" />Use Earth terrain, gravity maps, and DEM-based models for research, simulation, and analytical projects.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n \t<li data-start=\"2222\" data-end=\"2344\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2224\" data-end=\"2344\"><strong data-start=\"2224\" data-end=\"2258\">3D Rendering and Motion Design</strong><br data-start=\"2258\" data-end=\"2261\" />Create realistic planetary scenes, space visualizations, and cinematic sequences.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n \t<li data-start=\"2346\" data-end=\"2486\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2348\" data-end=\"2486\"><strong data-start=\"2348\" data-end=\"2383\">Game Development and Simulation</strong><br data-start=\"2383\" data-end=\"2386\" />Suitable as reference assets or base models for planetary environments and space-related projects.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n \t<li data-start=\"2488\" data-end=\"2612\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2490\" data-end=\"2612\"><strong data-start=\"2490\" data-end=\"2528\">Cartography and Data Visualization</strong><br data-start=\"2528\" data-end=\"2531\" />Ideal for global-scale mapping, elevation studies, and comparative planetology.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<hr data-start=\"2614\" data-end=\"2617\" />\r\n\r\n<h2 data-start=\"2619\" data-end=\"2663\">Professional Quality and Flexible Formats</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2665\" data-end=\"2979\">All Solar System products are delivered in <strong data-start=\"2708\" data-end=\"2740\">industry-standard 3D formats</strong> such as <strong data-start=\"2749\" data-end=\"2764\">OBJ and C4D</strong>, ensuring compatibility with major 3D software and rendering engines. Models are optimized for performance while maintaining visual fidelity, making them suitable for both real-time and offline rendering workflows.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2981\" data-end=\"3227\">Whether you are looking for a <strong data-start=\"3011\" data-end=\"3039\">realistic Earth 3D model</strong>, a <strong data-start=\"3043\" data-end=\"3062\">planetary globe</strong>, a <strong data-start=\"3066\" data-end=\"3088\">Moon surface model</strong>, or a <strong data-start=\"3095\" data-end=\"3120\">detailed lunar crater</strong>, the Solar System category provides reliable, high-resolution assets for professional and educational use.</p>\r\n[/woodmart_text_block][/vc_column][/vc_row]",
